            total += x * (ion - affinity)
            weight += x
    return float(total / weight) if weight > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Composition-weighted Mulliken electronegativity from tabulated atomic ionization energies and electron affinities.","name":"mulliken_electronegativity_mean","source":"def feature(s):
