    return float(total / weight) if weight > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Hardness-weighted Mulliken electronegativity dispersion, measuring compositional charge-transfer propensity without fitted parameters.","name":"hardness_weighted_charge_transfer_propensity","source":"def feature(s):
